  "bank": "Original73 prefix plus two deterministic source-only proposal batches. Deduplicate integer policies; no target truth, observations or online-selected indices enter proposal generation. All four arms share the same final union.",
  "representation": "Recompute real d1000 public control mean4 coordinates and common50-grid observable risk10 coordinates using the frozen layout5 source maps. Reconstruct the deterministic risk encoder from exactly its old training rows if no serialized encoder exists; first reproduce old73 coordinates. No new source labels, source-law fit, GP fit, or target-informed scaling.",
  "response_units": "Identity mapping for f,g-tau,log sigma_f^2,log sigma_g^2. Formula uses normalized control-group means and global SD, not a dimension sum. L,sigma,alpha,weights,tau are identical; changes caused by actual policy/group geometry are not response-unit rescaling.",
  "selection": "Same fixed order3 moment KG and actual native-mixture raw updates. Round1 query/terminal sees release1 prefix; round2 sees full union. Stop chooses from full union using initialization only. Full union is restored once; latent future-point predictions never enter round1 selection.",
  "terminal": "Same fixed moment terminal utility as d50, direct single candidate, familywise delta.05. Stop uses360 independent verifier episodes and online358. Freeze all16 recommendations before any verifier, finish all verifiers before explicit truth scoring.",
  "mechanism_diagnostic": "Before outcomes, each round additionally freezes a terminal-only counterfactual holding current unsampled policy marginals at their pre-observation values while retaining actual updates at observed policies. Compare its recommendation to the full update at the same remaining budget. Score both conditional safe rewards after all terminal verification; this is not a fifth optimizer or independent deployed outcome. Also freeze a terminal intervention on new generated unsampled marginals only; score new-point initial/final and prerelease propagation after all verifiers.",
  "endpoints": "Four-arm actual certified safe reward; unsampled f/g/logvariance prediction errors; whether unsampled marginal propagation changes recommendation and its post-freeze conditional reward. Include negative transfers, rejected/false certificates, and non-contracting uncertainty.",
  "randomness": "Fresh seeds separate from previous fixed73 development. Same source-only proposal union across four repetitions; common init per repetition and independent search/verification streams as before.",
